# Google Cloud OAuth "Web application" client for the optional Google Drive backup.
# Leave empty to hide the Google Drive section in Storage & backups.
#
# The client ID is a public identifier. The secret is required by Google's
# "Web application" client type, but a static app cannot keep it private; treat
# it as a public value and keep the app's OAuth client scoped to the app's
# origins.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Optional TURN relay for device mirroring. PeerJS ships a public TURN server,
# but a phone hotspot may block it. Leave empty to use the default; set a relay
# you control to keep the connection alive on a hotspot.
VITE_TURN_URL=
VITE_TURN_USERNAME=
VITE_TURN_CREDENTIAL=
